  "body_html": "<div style=\"color:#11110E;line-height:1.55;\">\n<p style=\"font-size:1.35em;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#153252;margin:0 0 .6em;\">Nieuwe slang. In één minuut weer vrij douchen.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 1.2em;\">Lekt je oude doucheslang, zit hij vol kalk of draait hij steeds in de knoop? De Besjaar Doucheslang van 1,5 meter draai je er zonder gereedschap op. Met een universele ½\"-aansluiting aan beide kanten past hij op vrijwel elke handdouche en mengkraan – ook op alle Besjaar douchekoppen.</p>\n<div style=\"background:#EEF6FB;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin:0 0 1.2em;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:.8em;letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:600;color:#49627D;margin:0 0 .7em;line-height:1.4;text-transform:none;\">Wat je merkt</h2>\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;\">\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0 0 .55em;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>1,5 m lang: alle bewegingsvrijheid onder de douche en in bad</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0 0 .55em;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>Anti-draai bescherming: de slang draait niet in de knoop</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0 0 .55em;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>Universele ½\"-aansluiting (G½) aan beide kanten</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0 0 .55em;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>Flexibele metalen spiraal met een glanzende chroomlook</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>Handvast aandraaien, geen gereedschap nodig</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:.8em;letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:600;color:#49627D;margin:0 0 .7em;line-height:1.4;text-transform:none;\">In de doos</h2>\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 1.2em;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;\">\n<li style=\"margin:0;font-size:.85em;color:#153252;border:1px solid #C9DBE8;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;line-height:1.3;\">1× Besjaar Doucheslang 1,5 m</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:.8em;letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:600;color:#49627D;margin:0 0 .3em;line-height:1.4;text-transform:none;\">Specificaties</h2>\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 1.2em;font-size:.95em;\">\n<li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6EEF4;\">\n<span style=\"color:#49627D;\">Lengte</span><span style=\"text-align:right;\">1,5 m (150 cm)</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6EEF4;\">\n<span style=\"color:#49627D;\">Aansluiting</span><span style=\"text-align:right;\">2× ½\" (G½) binnendraad</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6EEF4;\">\n<span style=\"color:#49627D;\">Afwerking</span><span style=\"text-align:right;\">Chroom</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6EEF4;\">\n<span style=\"color:#49627D;\">Geschikt voor</span><span style=\"text-align:right;\">Handdouches en kranen met ½\"-aansluiting, waaronder alle Besjaar douchekoppen</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;margin:0;\">\n<span style=\"color:#49627D;\">Montage</span><span style=\"text-align:right;\">Handvast, zonder gereedschap</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 1.2em;font-size:.9em;color:#49627D;\">Douchekop niet inbegrepen. Zoek je een complete set? Kies dan de Besjaar Douchekop met Slang.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #E6EEF4;font-weight:600;color:#153252;\">Besjaar. Douchen met een volle straal.</p>\n</div>",
